  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed vehicular access will result in vehicles reversing from or onto Bury Street West, to the detriment of highway safety and free flow of traffic, including pedestrians and public transport. In these respects, the proposal would be contrary to the Council's Technical Footway Guidance (2013), Policy DMD 46 of the Development Management Document (2014), and the Core Strategy (2010) Policies CP24 and CP30, as well as the aims of the NPPF (2024)\r",
    "In the absence of any proposed drainage and surfacing details, the proposal fails to demonstrate that there will be satisfactory drainage and surfacing infrastructure to prevent surface water run off from the site onto the public highway. Therefore, the proposal is contrary to National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies CP21, CP24 , CP28, CP29,  of the Core Strategy (2010) and Policies DMD45, DMD46, DMD47, DMD49 and DMD59 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014).\r\r"
  ],
